        <item>
            <title>Version 2.1.1 — Critical Activation Fix</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>66</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>🚨 Critical Bug Fix — License Activation</h3>
                <p><strong>All paying customers unable to activate in v2.1.0 and earlier.</strong></p>
                <p>Fixed: Gumroad license verification now uses the correct API parameter (<code>product_id</code>).
                Previous versions returned "the product_id parameter is required" error.</p>
                <p><strong>If you purchased and could not activate:</strong> Update to v2.1.1 and re-enter your license key in Settings → Activation.</p>

                <h3>What's in v2.1.x</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Interactive touchscreen setup wizard with auto-diagnostics</li>
                    <li>Multi-display calibration and pointer acceleration fixes</li>
                    <li>New brand app icon</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
